<title>ITALY: Gross yield rises on 3-month Italian T-bills.</title>
<headline>Gross yield rises on 3-month Italian T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for the sale of 36.5 trillion lire of three, six and 12-month short-term Treasury bills (BOTs).</p>
<p>		 Gross yield  (last)    Avge price   (last)</p>
<p>    3-month     6.73	(6.09)    98.35	  (98.52)</p>
<p>    6-month     6.84	(6.56)    96.70	  (96.85)</p>
<p>    1-year	6.74	(6.52)    93.70	  (93.85)</p>
<p>Note: results compared with a previous auction on February 11.</p>
</text>
